OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786711712
OL,3,CRepairs to fire damaged A31 not
OL,4,Cexpected to start until Friday at the
OL,5,Cearliest
OL,7,FRepairs to the A31 in Hampshire which
OL,8,Fwas damaged by a fire are not expected
OL,9,Fto start until Friday at the earliest,
OL,10,FNational Highways has said.
OL,12,FThe fire began on the eastbound
OL,13,Fcarriageway of the A31 - the main
OL,14,Froute through the New Forest - after a
OL,15,Fvan caught fire, before spreading to
OL,16,Fnearby heathland in a easterly
OL,17,Fdirection towards Backley Bottom.
OL,19,FCrews from Hampshire Fire and Rescue
OL,20,FService and neighbouring services have
OL,21,Fbeen battling the blaze since Sunday.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
