OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786711712
OL,3,CRepairs to fire damaged A31 not
OL,4,Cexpected to start until Friday at the
OL,5,Cearliest
OL,7,FIt's impacted roughly 1.6 square
OL,8,Fkilometres of heathland.
OL,10,FOn Wednesday (12 August) Hampshire and
OL,11,FIsle of Wight Fire and Rescue Service
OL,12,Fsaid: "Firefighters have a good hold
OL,13,Fof the perimeter of the fire, with
OL,14,Fprogress being made to implement fire
OL,15,Fbreaks, however changing wind
OL,16,Fconditions continue to prove
OL,17,Fchallenging, so if residents are
OL,18,Faffected by smoke in their area, they
OL,19,Fare advised to close doors and
OL,20,Fwindows."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
