OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786711712
OL,3,CRepairs to fire damaged A31 not
OL,4,Cexpected to start until Friday at the
OL,5,Cearliest
OL,7,FNational Highways said significant
OL,8,Frepairs are needed to the road
OL,9,Fsurface, safety barrier, bridge
OL,10,Fparapets and boundary fencing.
OL,12,FIn a statement, a spokesperson said:
OL,13,F"Repairs can only begin once Hampshire
OL,14,Fand Isle of Wight Fire and Rescue
OL,15,FService (HIOW) confirms it's safe to
OL,16,Faccess the road. This is not expected
OL,17,Fto be the case until Friday at the
OL,18,Fearliest.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786711712
OL,3,CRepairs to fire damaged A31 not
OL,4,Cexpected to start until Friday at the
OL,5,Cearliest
OL,7,F"Smoke, heat, ash and the fire's
OL,8,Fongoing movement mean safe access
OL,9,Fisn't yet possible.
OL,11,F"We have crews on standby ready for
OL,12,Fwhen access is granted, and we will be
OL,13,Fworking round the clock to fully open
OL,14,Fthe road as soon as possible.
OL,16,F"Until then, drivers should follow the
OL,17,Fofficial local diversion route rather
OL,18,Fthan satnav directions, keep to local
OL,19,Fspeed limits and watch for livestock
OL,20,Froaming freely in the New Forest."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786711712
OL,3,CRepairs to fire damaged A31 not
OL,4,Cexpected to start until Friday at the
OL,5,Cearliest
OL,7,FThey added: "Since carrying out our
OL,8,Fassessments, we've sourced around
OL,9,F1,000 metres of replacement boundary
OL,10,Ffencing, stored nearby and ready to
OL,11,Finstall.
OL,13,F"These protections are essential for
OL,14,Fsafety reasons to stop animals from
OL,15,Fentering the road.
OL,17,F"We'll also repair a substantial
OL,18,Famount of safety barrier across five
OL,19,Flocations.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786711712
OL,3,CRepairs to fire damaged A31 not
OL,4,Cexpected to start until Friday at the
OL,5,Cearliest
OL,7,F"Once we have access, repairs
OL,8,Fincluding resurfacing are likely to
OL,9,Ftake at least 24 hours before the road
OL,10,Fcan reopen safely.
OL,12,F"Temporary protection will be put
OL,13,Faround the parapets which were damaged
OL,14,Fby the fire, meaning the road will
OL,15,Freopen with narrow lanes and a 50mph
OL,16,Fspeed limit in each direction.
OL,18,F"Permanent repairs will be carried out
OL,19,Fat a later date."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
